# Tauri-generated platform scaffolds. Both directories are
# regenerated by `cargo tauri android init` / `cargo tauri ios init`
# from tauri.conf.json + a small set of patch files in
# packaging/android/ (Gradle signing config etc). Keeping them out
# of the repo means we don't drift when Tauri or the Android Gradle
# Plugin bumps templates.
gen/android/
gen/ios/

# Local-build leftovers
target/
